---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';import {modules} from '../data/modules';
---
<Layout title="SEMS-ERP | Smart School Management Software" description="SEMS-ERP brings student management, attendance, academics, fee collection, homework, portals and reporting together for schools.">
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><span class="pill">One connected school management platform</span><h1 class="h1">Your school.<br />More organised.<br /><span class="text-indigo">More connected.</span></h1><p class="lead">Bring admissions, student records, academics, attendance, fees and school communication into one thoughtfully organised workspace. Less switching between systems. More time for what matters.</p><div class="actions"><a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Request a Personal Demo ↗</a><a href="/features/" class="btn btn-outline">Explore All Features →</a></div><p style="font-size:.8rem;color:#7a738b;margin-top:20px">Explore real workflows. No unverified automation promises.</p></div><div class="preview" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative dashboard layout showing school summary cards and an activity chart, not an actual product screenshot"><div class="preview-top"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:.65rem;color:#8d839d">SEMS-ERP · Dashboard concept</span></div><div class="preview-inner"><div class="preview-banner"><small>YOUR SCHOOL WORKSPACE</small><strong>Everything in one place.</strong><small>Students · Academics · Operations</small></div><div class="preview-stats"><div class="preview-stat"><small>Student records</small><strong>360°</strong></div><div class="preview-stat"><small>Academic views</small><strong>10+</strong></div><div class="preview-stat"><small>Connected workflows</small><strong>✓</strong></div></div><div style="font-size:.7rem;color:#6c6282;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0">ILLUSTRATIVE ACTIVITY VIEW</div><div class="preview-chart">{[36,61,46,80,55,89,70,96].map(h=><span style={`height:${h}%`}></span>)}</div></div></div></div></section>
<div class="trust-strip"><div class="container trust-row"><span>Student-first records</span><span>Role-aware access</span><span>Practical school workflows</span><span>Exportable reporting</span></div></div>
<section class="section" id="features"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Explore the platform</span><h2 class="h2">Every school day, <span class="text-indigo">better connected.</span></h2><p class="lead">A detailed set of tools for the people, processes and records that keep your school running.</p></div><div class="grid3">{modules.slice(0,6).map(m=><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{m.icon}</div><h3>{m.title}</h3><p>{m.short}</p><a href={`/features/${m.slug}/`}>Explore module →</a></article>)}</div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:35px"><a href="/features/" class="btn btn-outline">View All 10 Feature Groups →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">A clearer school picture</span><h2 class="h2">The right information, <span class="text-teal">in the right place.</span></h2><p class="lead">SEMS-ERP connects everyday records to the people who use them. A student profile brings together relevant academic, attendance, fee and document information while school dashboards surface operational priorities.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Student 360 profiles bring records into one workspace.</li><li>Role-aware navigation helps users focus on relevant tasks.</li><li>Reports and CSV exports support school administration.</li></ul><div class="actions"><a href="/features/students-admissions/" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Student 360 →</a></div></div><div class="mock-surface"><span class="eyebrow">Illustrative workflow</span><h3 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin:12px 0 25px">Student information at a glance</h3>{[['Student profile','Active record'],['Academics','Results & remarks'],['Attendance','Daily records'],['Fees','Challans & receipts'],['Documents','Managed files']].map(([label,value])=><div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-label">{label}</span><span class="mock-chip">{value}</span></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">How it fits together</span><h2 class="h2">From the first admission to the final report.</h2><p class="lead">Follow a practical, connected school workflow.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span class="step-num">01 / ENROL</span><h3>Welcome students</h3><p>Review applications, enrol students and maintain their profiles.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">02 / ORGANISE</span><h3>Plan academics</h3><p>Set up classes, sections, subjects and weekly timetables.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">03 / MANAGE</span><h3>Run the school day</h3><p>Record attendance, publish assignments and manage fees.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">04 / UNDERSTAND</span><h3>Review progress</h3><p>Explore exam results, operational reports and school analytics.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark-section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">For the whole school</span><h2 class="h2">Built around the roles that make a school work.</h2><p class="lead">Administrators, principals, teachers, accountants, parents and students see different areas of the platform according to their assigned access.</p><div class="actions"><a href="/features/portals/" class="btn btn-white">Explore School Portals →</a></div></div><div class="grid2"><div class="mini-stat"><strong>School leaders</strong><p>Oversight and administrative actions</p></div><div class="mini-stat"><strong>Teachers</strong><p>Classes, attendance and coursework</p></div><div class="mini-stat"><strong>Accountants</strong><p>Fees and financial records</p></div><div class="mini-stat"><strong>Families</strong><p>Linked student information and tasks</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Explore before you decide</span><h2 class="h2">Take a closer look at the platform.</h2><p class="lead">Explore the feature workflows and see an illustrative preview of the SEMS-ERP experience. For an accurate demonstration of your school's requirements, speak to our team.</p><div class="actions"><a href="/product-tour/" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Product Tour →</a></div></div><figure class="tour-screen"><img src="/images/product/dashboard-preview.png" alt="Illustrative school ERP dashboard preview with sample information" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"/><figcaption>Illustrative preview. Actual application screens may differ.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Practical outcomes</span><h2 class="h2">A clearer workflow for every department.</h2><p class="lead">See how everyday tasks translate into usable records and follow-up actions.</p></div><div class="grid3">{[{n:'01',t:'Admissions office',d:'Move applications through review decisions, enrol approved candidates and maintain complete student profiles.',l:'students-admissions'},{n:'02',t:'Academic coordination',d:'Organise class sections and teachers, enter marks, manage coursework and review academic results.',l:'academics-timetable'},{n:'03',t:'Accounts department',d:'Prepare challans, record received payments, print receipts and identify outstanding balances.',l:'fees-finance'},{n:'04',t:'Teaching teams',d:'Take daily attendance, publish assignments and provide feedback on student submissions.',l:'attendance-leave'},{n:'05',t:'School leadership',d:'Review operational dashboards, student distributions, attendance and assessment reports.',l:'reports-analytics'},{n:'06',t:'Families and learners',d:'Access linked student information, view available report cards and follow assignments.',l:'portals'}].map(x=><article class="feature-card outcome-card"><span class="eyebrow">TEAM {x.n}</span><h3>{x.t}</h3><p>{x.d}</p><a href={`/features/${x.l}/`}>Explore the workflow →</a></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">A realistic demonstration</span><h2 class="h2">See the workflows that matter to your school.</h2><p class="lead">Whether your priority is attendance, fee collection or student records, a guided conversation can focus on the processes your team handles every day.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Review actual module screens during a demonstration.</li><li>Discuss access requirements for school staff and families.</li><li>Identify which existing workflows the platform can support.</li></ul><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Request a tailored demo ↗</a></div></div><div class="insight-panel light-panel"><span class="eyebrow">Questions worth asking</span><div class="question-list"><p><strong>Admissions:</strong> How does an approved applicant become a student?</p><p><strong>Attendance:</strong> How do teachers save a class roll call?</p><p><strong>Finance:</strong> How are challans, payments and receipts linked?</p><p><strong>Academics:</strong> How are marks entered and report cards printed?</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="inside-sems"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">A DEEPER LOOK / THE PLATFORM</span><h2 class="h2">Not just a list of features. <span class="text-teal">A working school system.</span></h2><p class="lead">Every school department has its own routine. SEMS-ERP gives each team a dedicated workflow while keeping relevant student and operational information available in connected views.</p></div><div class="capability-stack">{[{n:'01',t:'The admissions office',d:'Record an applicant’s requested grade, previous-school details and guardian information. Track decisions through review and enrol approved applicants into student records.',slug:'students-admissions'},{n:'02',t:'The academic coordinator',d:'Define classes, sections, rooms and subjects. Allocate lessons to teachers and check for room, teacher and class conflicts when saving a timetable slot.',slug:'academics-timetable'},{n:'03',t:'The classroom teacher',d:'Take daily roll call, create subject assignments, attach learning materials, review student submissions and record marks with remarks.',slug:'attendance-leave'},{n:'04',t:'The accounts team',d:'Prepare monthly challans, generate class-wide batches, record payments against vouchers and print receipts while reviewing unpaid balances.',slug:'fees-finance'},{n:'05',t:'The school leadership team',d:'Inspect enrolment distribution, attendance reports, financial information and assessment summaries; export relevant data to CSV.',slug:'reports-analytics'}].map(x=><article class="capability-item"><div class="capability-index">{x.n}</div><div><h3>{x.t}</h3><p>{x.d}</p><a href={`/features/${x.slug}/`} style="display:inline-block;margin-top:15px;color:#5036c9;font-weight:800">Read the detailed workflow ↗</a></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">IMPLEMENTATION CONVERSATIONS</span><h2 class="h2">Questions worth answering <span class="text-indigo">before your school adopts software.</span></h2><p class="lead">A credible product demonstration should make the everyday processes clear—not just show a polished dashboard.</p></div><div class="grid2">{[{q:'How does a student move from admission to enrolment?',a:'Review the application statuses, approval action, student creation and Student 360 record.',l:'students-admissions'},{q:'How are staff prevented from double-booking a lesson?',a:'Inspect the teacher, room and class-section conflict checks when a timetable slot is saved.',l:'academics-timetable'},{q:'How is a payment reflected against a challan?',a:'Follow challan generation, manual payment entry, reference recording and receipt printing.',l:'fees-finance'},{q:'What can parents and students actually do?',a:'Explore linked child information, printable vouchers, exam views and student assignment submissions.',l:'portals'}].map(x=><article class="detail"><h3 style="font-size:1.45rem;color:#241454">{x.q}</h3><p style="font-size:1rem">{x.a}</p><a href={`/features/${x.l}/`} style="display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;font-weight:800;color:#5036c9">See how it works →</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND REAL SCHOOL TASKS</span><h2 class="h2">The detail behind <span class="text-teal">every school day.</span></h2><p class="lead">A management platform earns its place by making routine tasks clear, repeatable and reviewable. Explore the actual steps supported in SEMS-ERP rather than relying on broad feature labels.</p></div><div class="focus-grid"><article class="focus-card"><span class="eyebrow">01 / STUDENT LIFECYCLE</span><h3>From application to Student 360</h3><p>Review applicant information, record admission decisions, enrol approved candidates and maintain a student record with guardian, academic, attendance, fee and document views.</p><a href="/features/students-admissions/" class="btn btn-outline">Explore admissions →</a></article><article class="focus-card"><span class="eyebrow">02 / SCHOOL FINANCE</span><h3>From challan to receipt</h3><p>Prepare individual or class-wide fee challans, print bank-style vouchers, record received payments and review outstanding balances. Payment processing is not presented as a gateway.</p><a href="/features/fees-finance/" class="btn btn-outline">Explore finance →</a></article><article class="focus-card"><span class="eyebrow">03 / TEACHING & LEARNING</span><h3>From assignment to feedback</h3><p>Teachers create coursework with deadlines and attachments. Students submit work through their portal, and teachers record scores and written feedback.</p><a href="/features/homework/" class="btn btn-outline">Explore coursework →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="proof-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#70e4d9">PRODUCT WALKTHROUGH</span><h2>See the platform behind the promise.</h2><p>The product tour introduces real workflows and clearly labels illustrative material. Ask for a guided demonstration to inspect the live interfaces relevant to your school's requirements.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-teal" href="/product-tour/">Open product tour →</a><a class="btn btn-white" href="/contact/">Arrange a walkthrough ↗</a></div></div><figure class="product-proof"><img src="/images/product/dashboard-preview.png" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative SEMS-ERP school dashboard with sample information"/><figcaption>Illustrative dashboard concept, not an authenticated screenshot of the production application.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<CTA/>
</Layout>
